t\n- **Studio:** re-prompt for API key on 401/403 responses and harden header visibility\n- **Models:** correct Z-Image Base download URL filename casing\n- **McpCliStudio:** remove duplicated helpers and orphan code that broke Vite build\n- **Local-AI:** include model name and ID in download error messages\n- **Linux:** bundled local inference packaging for Linux builds\n- **Workflow/Design Agent:** updated UI components and Tailwind/jsconfig paths\n\n## Downloads\n\n- **Windows:** Open.Generative.AI.Setup.2.0.0.exe\n- **macOS (Apple Silicon):** Open.Generative.AI-2.0.0-arm64.dmg\n- **macOS (Intel):** Open.Generative.AI-2.0.0.dmg\n- **Linux (AppImage):** Open.Generative.AI-2.0.0.AppImage\n- **Linux (Debian/Ubuntu):** open-generative-ai_2.0.0_amd64.deb","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"Open Generative AI 完整上手指南：免费、无过滤的 600+ 模型 AI 图像与视频生成工作室","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_00544/article/details/167269223","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-11-04"},{"title":"Open Generative AI本地部署终极指南：无需GPU也能运行的AI生成方案","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_00995/article/details/153802327","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-05-22"},{"title":"Open Generative AI多语言支持：国际化与本地化配置完全指南","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_00323/article/details/155653289","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-05-22"},{"title":"Higgsfield AI free，开源工具还是按量付费模型，哪个更划算","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxOclhNUndZSDVkZ2o5TGZGNktSZzdHbGxfSllCWTE2cmFkczBvekc2UjBNd1ZPWnVxakNYWDR6NUVOWExkWmxJM0N1SjBiREE5MzdXa3BvUEJiOVZYa1czUzNKZHdTMTQ0aGFCdUdQbzY3YjRqbTVSZlhUS1BXZjRsWmlFZE14djN6WTNmSw?oc=5","source":"Pasquale Pillitteri","lang":"zh","date":"2026-09-24"},{"title":"Higgsfield AI free, open source or pay-per-use models, which is cheaper","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNSW1uQTRRWjl4Q0hIbUFYNjIzNmlSUVd4RWpJLXhtOFU3VS1XREYyQmgwTll1R3hycjNIdTVyel9ZemhwREFLYXozQlBPOUJ2WEd3b1k1alh1M1pGZ2N6MlRzWEZXSTVZZ